# Only the chosen half of a split card is evaluated to see if it can be cast (CR 709.3a, 601.3e; Gaddock Teeg's ruling).
# Cease // Desist has a combined mana value of 8 (CR 709.4b), but Cease is mana value 2 and Desist 6. On turn 3, with seven
# mana floating (Desist's {4}{G/W}{G/W} could be paid) under Bot1's own Gaddock Teeg, Desist may not be cast; Cease is, and
# Bot1 gains 2 life and draws a card.

